# RecipeMate AI Agent Instructions
# See AGENTS.md for the complete specification.

- All UI strings MUST be in French (fr-FR).
- All code, symbols, variables and comments are in English.
- Use Material 3 design tokens from `lib/core/theme/` (`AppColors`, `AppTextStyles`, `AppTheme`).
- Use Riverpod (`flutter_riverpod`) for state management.
- Use GoRouter (`go_router`) for declarative navigation.
- Strictly respect feature ownership boundaries (Adem, Molka, Farah).
- Always ensure `dart format .`, `flutter analyze`, and `flutter test` pass with 0 errors.
